sequenceDiagram
    participant CS as Charging Station (Test System)
    participant CSMS as CSMS (System under Test)

    Note over CS,CSMS: Prerequisite(s): N/a
    Note over CS,CSMS: Configuration State: N/a
    Note over CS,CSMS: Memory State: N/a
    Note over CS,CSMS: Execute Reusable State EVConnectedPreSession
    Note over CS,CSMS: Execute Reusable State Authorized
    Note over CS,CSMS: Execute Reusable State ISO15118SmartCharging (iso15118-20)

    CS->>CSMS: NotifyEVChargingNeedsRequest (evseId = <Configured evseId>, maxScheduleTuples = 1, chargingNeeds.requestedEnergyTransfer = AC_three_phase, chargingNeeds.controlMode = ScheduledControl)
    Note right of CS: chargingNeeds.availableEnergyTransfer = [AC_single_phase, AC_three_phase, AC_BPT]<br>chargingNeeds.v2xChargingParameters.maxChargePower = 6000<br>chargingNeeds.v2xChargingParameters.maxDischargePower = 0

    CSMS-->>CS: NotifyEVChargingNeedsResponse
    Note over CSMS: Validation: status must be Accepted or Processing

    Note over CS,CSMS: If NotifyEVChargingNeedsResponse status was Processing,<br>the Test System will wait 60 seconds for the request
    CSMS->>CS: SetChargingProfileRequest
    Note over CSMS: Validation: evseId must be <Configured evseId><br>chargingProfilePurpose must be TxProfile<br>transactionId must be <Provided transactionId from before><br>chargingProfile.chargingSchedule must be size = 1

    CS-->>CSMS: SetChargingProfileResponse (status = Accepted)

    CS->>CSMS: NotifyEVChargingScheduleRequest (evseId = <Configured evseId>, chargingSchedule = <ChargingSchedule provided at step 3>)

    CSMS-->>CS: NotifyEVChargingScheduleResponse
    Note over CSMS: Validation: status must be Accepted

    Note over CS,CSMS: Post scenario validations: N/a
